                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wafilisti waliposikia ya kwamba Daudi ametiwa mafuta ili awe mfalme wa Israeli wote, Wafilisti wote wakapanda kumtafuta Daudi; naye Daudi akasikia, akatoka nje kupigana nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nya 11:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi hao Wafilisti walikuwa wamekuja na kujitawanya katika bonde la Warefai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamwuliza Mungu, akisema, Je! Nipande juu ya Wafilisti! Utawatia mikononi mwangu? Naye BWANA akamwambia, Panda; kwa kuwa nitawatia mikononi mwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi wakapanda mpaka Baal-perasimu, Daudi naye akawapiga huko; Daudi akasema, BWANA amewafurikia adui zangu kwa mkono wangu, kama mafuriko ya maji. Basi wakapaita mahali pale jina lake Baal-perasimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wakaiacha miungu yao huko; naye Daudi akaamuru, ikateketezwa kwa moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
